<p>The point about the thermoplastic is&#8230; well&#8230; good. Fixing that now. :P</p>
<p>However, saying that what subjects are seeing is definitively not light because it doesn't act like light is like saying that mirrors touched by <a href="/scp-093">SCP-093</a> are definitively not mirrors because they turn into portals. I'm adding a bit of clarification, but I'm not sure that explicitly stating the nature of the &quot;light&quot; (or whatever the hell it is that people keep seeing) is really necessary.</p>
<p>Also,</p>
<blockquote>
<p>the ramifications of this thing being a possible cognitohazard</p>
</blockquote>
<p>What?</p>

